Search → Data Advantage → AI/Cloud Expansion → Network Effects  
Alphabet’s search dominance generates vast data, fueling its AI capabilities and cloud growth. These advancements reinforce its competitive position in advertising and enterprise solutions, creating a self-reinforcing loop. **Durability Verdict:** High — structural advantages are durable and scalable.

